<JAX> The UNITED STATES CHESS FEDERATION ...
<JAX> has managed to get on line with a third-party service ...
<JAX> and they have a membership base ...
<JAX> of about 49,000 ...
<JAX> they have been thru many trials over their sixty years of existence ...
<JAX> but they might be examined/consulted by FIG as a model ...
<JAX> for an enthusiast organization ....
<JAX> that has managed to come out in the black ...
<JAX> despite severely limited mass appeal.
<JAX> .
<[Dennis] D.RUFFER> ok
<[Dennis] D.RUFFER> 49,000, how about 2500?...
<JAX> really?
<JAX> ugh.
<[Dennis] D.RUFFER> for 50,000 people we could do a lot more!
<JAX> 2500? you are kidding, no?
<[Gary] GARY-S> no
