<[Dennis] D.RUFFER> with (almost) nothing but volunteer workers...
<JAX> > a service organization is doing it ... huh? doing what?
<[Dennis] D.RUFFER> answering phones, mail, subscriptions...
<[Dennis] D.RUFFER> handling questions, throwing FORML...
<[Dennis] D.RUFFER> and all the other management tasks that an...
<[Dennis] D.RUFFER> organization has to do.  Believe me, this is no...
<[Dennis] D.RUFFER> small task, and we don't pay them enough to...
<[Dennis] D.RUFFER> dedicate their entire resources to us, but...
<[Dennis] D.RUFFER> they do a remarkable job, just the same.
