<JAX>
<JAX> The Monster Machines like BIX CSERVE GENIE ...
<JAX> are for the Commercial Endeavour aimed at the Unwashed ....
<JAX> For convenience and utility ...
<JAX> for programmers ...
<JAX> you currently CANNOT BEAT a unix system ...
<JAX> look ...
<JAX> with UNIX ...
<[Gary] GARY-S> !!
<JAX> You have UUCP which goes AROUND THE GLOBE ...
<JAX> you have USENET ..
<JAX> AND ...
<JAX> each user has a FILING SYSTEM ...
<JAX> which nothing I have seen on the Godzillas ...
<JAX> compares to ...
<JAX> combined with the fact ...
<JAX> that you can get a nine-user system up for about three thousand dollars ..
<JAX> as SUN says, "the computer is only as good as the network .."
<JAX> and UNIX is king of the NET ...
<JAX> until WE get MOVING and have a FORTH net ...
<JAX> we are at the mercy of this GEnie monster ...
<JAX> only as long as we don't have a useful  FORTH net.
<JAX> .
